      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, yes!!!\n\nSkPath, SkPathBuilder, SkPath:Factories, SkPathData::Factories, all of these have their own notions of fixing (or not) inverted bounds (so does SkCanvas::drawRect btw).\n\nI propose we try a tiny CL in flutter itself, where they wrap MakeOval, MakeRRect, etc. to have flutter do whatever fix-up they want. That way they hare future-proofed against present/future Skia\u0027s (semi) undefined behavior.",
